        if (host === domain || host.endsWith(`.${domain}`)) {
            return `https://${target}`;
        } else {
            return `https://${domain}`;
        }
    } catch (error) {
        return `https://${domain}`;
    }
}
```

This revised version accurately checks for subdomains and handles URL parsing errors gracefully.

